ref=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sleep-tight\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/788/418/638141921847312709.png\" alt=\"Sleep Tight\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/polytone\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/931/583/638405407858849835.png\" alt=\"Polytone\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/heartstone\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/488/555/637793261935851502.gif\" alt=\"Heartstone\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/map-atlases-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/878/615/638305506575137108.png\" alt=\"Map Atlases\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sawmill\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/936/946/638414707400791480.png\" alt=\"Universal Sawmill\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a></span></span></p>",
